OL,3,GNEWSANew options considered for Pimlico
OL,4,Aheat network
OL,5,
OL,6,FA communal heating system, believed to
OL,7,Fbe the oldest in the UK, could be
OL,8,Freplaced with a mix of air-source heat
OL,9,Fpumps and individual boilers as
OL,10,Falternatives to expensive modernisation
OL,11,Fof the ageing network.
OL,13,FThe 70-year-old Pimlico District Heat
OL,14,FUndertaking (PDHU) supplies heating and
OL,15,Fhot water to more than 3,000 homes and
OL,16,Fbusinesses.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
