OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew options considered for Pimlico
OL,4,Aheat network
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestminster City Council leader Paul
OL,7,FSwaddle called on the government for
OL,8,Ffinancial help to replace it, saying
OL,9,Ffunding would help "put in an
OL,10,Fenvironmentally friendly system that
OL,11,Fsupports everyone".
OL,13,FFinding a long-term solution for the
OL,14,Fageing network has been controversial,
OL,15,Fwith some residents calling for
OL,16,Findividual heating systems so they can
OL,17,Fbe "billed fairly".
